<title>AUSTRIA: BWT posts record 96 earnings,net up 27pct.</title>
<headline>BWT posts record 96 earnings,net up 27pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria's BWT, the leading manufacturer of water treatment technology in Europe, reported on Tuesday a record set of group earnings for 1996 and said it planned to pay an unchanged dividend of 27 schillings.</p>
<p>Group pretax profit jumped to 231.1 million schillings from 191.4 million in 1995 and net profit climbed to 168.2 million from 132.2 million.</p>
</text>
